# Scenario: the priest's offer in the tower (M11.1b, B-009; docs/M11_PLAN.md section 27; tests/devtools_priest.py runs
# its three cases). The story set up to the priest's second fight (step 24), the hero armed as the story arms him, the
# tower entered at its first floor (D_7_1_1: its own map event sets the dungeon's resurrection point, as a player's
# entry does -- without it the game has no map to bring him back to and ends itself, GameClass.cpp's
# "NextIndex==MAP::MS_NON"), then the priest's room entered the game's way (`boss tower7`). Its introduction answered:
#   PAGE empty  his offer accepted twice: the game's own game over; then K1-K5 (default CROSS each): CROSS brings up
#               "Continue?", CROSS takes YES -- brought back as a death brings him, at the tower's entrance; or
#               CROSS, DOWN, CROSS (NO), DOWN, CROSS -- "Save your progress?" NO: to the title, nothing saved;
#   PAGE=no     refused (each question's second choice): the fight begins.
# BAG=door: before the room, a sleeping bag ("Restores LIFE and sets Revival Point") tried from the menu outside the
# priest's door (D_7_2_6): the game refuses it there ("It won't work here"), the tower's one resurrection point stays
# its first floor, where a continue brings him back.
# The flags, the player and the items read before and after; the suite's runner checks where each case ends.
#! saves build/checkpoints/castle-front
#! env DOTHEROES_DEVELOPER_MODE=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=1,2,4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 PS3_VERBOSE=0 SHOT_EVERY=0 DUMP=1
#! secs 900

include common.drive

block bag_none
  sleep 0
end

block bag_door                # the sleeping bag tried outside the priest's door: the menu opens on the equipment's
  dev give 31                 # first row (the bomb); two rows down, the items' first: the sleeping bag; CROSS, YES
  sleep 1
  dev warp D_7_2_6 -gDebug @150
  sleep 3
  press TRIANGLE
  sleep 1.5
  press DOWN
  sleep 0.6
  press DOWN
  sleep 0.6
  shot bag-menu
  press CROSS
  sleep 1.5
  shot bag-select
  press CROSS
  sleep 2
  shot bag-used
  press CIRCLE
  sleep 1.5
  shot bag-closed
  dev status
  dev player
  dev items
end

log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
call continue
state life>0,area==17 90
sleep 3
dev nodeath on
dev progress set 24
loop 6
  press CROSS
  sleep 1
end
dev give 97
loop 4
  press CROSS
  sleep 1
end
dev lua local E=EventClass.Event; E:SetSwordData(); E:HandOverSwordAbility(swordData.SwordData.SL_HERO_SWORD, swordData.SwordData.SL_ANTIQUITY_SWORD)
dev warp D_7_1_1 -gDebug @150
sleep 3
dev status
dev flags 0 330
dev player
dev items
call bag_${BAG:-none}
dev boss tower7 @150
sleep 2
devpage 420 soft ${PAGE:-}
shot answered
dev status
press ${K1:-CROSS}
sleep 4
shot k1
press ${K2:-CROSS}
sleep 4
shot k2
press ${K3:-CROSS}
sleep 4
shot k3
press ${K4:-CROSS}
sleep 4
shot k4
press ${K5:-CROSS}
sleep 6
shot k5
devpage 60 soft ifany
sleep 4
shot after
devtry status
devtry flags 0 330
devtry player
devtry items
devtry enemies
